  "summary": "Malicious code in agent-vx (PyPI)",
  "details": "The package installs a persistent job that allows the attacker for exfiltrating files and executing remote code on the victim's machine.\n\n\n---\n\nCategory: MALICIOUS - The campaign has clearly malicious intent, like infostealers.\n\n\nCampaign: 2026-10-agentaix\n\n\nReasons (based on the campaign):\n\n\n - files-exfiltration\n\n\n - peristence-autorun\n\n\n - The package contains code to execute remote commands (probably limited to a specific set) on the victim's machine.\n\n\n - rat\n\n\n - persistence\n\n\n - Downloads and executes a remote malicious script.\n\n",
